      "title": {
        "en": "Praise for patient pet stylists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners frequently praise individual stylists including Emma, Kevin, and Lisa for their polite and attentive service. Reviewers note that groomers demonstrate great patience with first-time puppies and rescue dogs during bathing and nail trimming. While two customers reported negative encounters involving impatient intake or clipped skin, the vast majority highlight skilled and friendly personnel."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Consistent grooming cuts and nail trims"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients are generally very satisfied with the appearance and cleanliness of their dogs following salon visits. Positive reviews note tidy breed-specific trims, thorough deshedding, and smooth nail grinds for small and large breeds alike. However, two reviewers reported negative experiences involving an uneven haircut and an ear nick that required veterinary attention."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling and calm environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple reviewers highlight that their pets feel relaxed and happy when arriving for grooming appointments. Pet parents appreciate that staff members handle timid and excitable dogs with care, building trust across repeat salon sessions. With the exception of one report of an injury during clipping, clients express confidence in leaving their pets with the team."
      }
    }
  ],
